      "scene": "",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "Hank",
          "line": "Young man, I could show you a thing or two about efficiency.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "Hank",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "John",
          "line": "You've got some learning to do, Captain.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "John",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "Hank",
          "line": "Efficiency? Really? That’s what we’re calling it these days?",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "Hank",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "John",
          "line": "Captain, maybe we should be talking about cooperation instead.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "John",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "Hank",
          "line": "Cooperation? You mean like sharing snacks during briefings?",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "Hank",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "John",
          "line": "That's right! And don't forget, it works both ways—sharing information too.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "John",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "Hank",
          "line": "Information. Right. Because in my day, we just used our noses.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "Hank",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "John",
          "line": "Sure, but at least now we have technology to back us up!",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "John",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "Hank",
          "line": "Technology. Oh yes, it’s all very well for the kids who know how to use it.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "Hank",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "John",
          "line": "And here I thought you were just grumpy because of your age.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "John",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "Hank",
          "line": "Age? Age is nothing compared to years of experience.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "Hank",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "John",
          "line": "Experience that doesn’t keep pace with the times. Captain,",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "John",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "Hank",
          "line": "This case has taught me a lot. About teamwork and patience, if not anything else.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "Hank",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
          "character": "John",
          "line": "I guess that means you’ve finally seen the light?",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "raw_name": "John",
          "match_score": 1.0
        },
        {
